# Vercel CLI uploads from the repo root, because the portals' build reads
# assets/geo/ (the subdivision boundary, shared with the Flutter app) as well
# as web-portal/. An allowlist: everything else here — the Flutter app,
# Android/iOS projects and their multi-GB build output — never leaves the machine.
/*
!/web-portal
!/assets
/assets/*
!/assets/geo

# Never uploaded: dependencies are installed by Vercel, outputs are rebuilt,
# and env files stay local (Vercel holds its own copy of the variables).
/web-portal/**/node_modules
/web-portal/**/dist
/web-portal/**/.env*
/web-portal/**/*.local
